# Convex rules
- Every query/mutation that returns user data must filter by authenticated userId.
- Store metadata only. Binaries stay in object storage.
- Admin surfaces require profiles.role === "admin".
- Job status updates from the API use a verified service secret on HTTP actions.
- Never expose JWT private keys or storage secrets to the client.
